title: The Delegates from the Ruhr
subtitle: They came through the French lines to be here.
view-if: congress_leipzig = 1 and congress_closing = 0 and e23_lz_ruhr_used = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.e23_lz_ruhr_used = 1;
Q.e23_lz_ruhr_left = (Q.district_ruhr_faction == 'offensive') ? 1 : 0;
!}
frequency: 150
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: congress

= The Delegates from the Ruhr

The Ruhr delegation arrives a day late. Its members crossed the French customs line on foot with their mandates sewn into their coat linings, and two of them spent a night in a guardroom in Bochum. When they come into the hall the whole congress stands up. [? if e23_lz_ruhr_left = 1 : They follow the Left, and they want the congress to talk about the Ruhr instead of Saxony. ?][? if e23_lz_ruhr_left = 0 : They are as divided as the pits they come from. ?]

- @promise: Promise the Ruhr money and organisers.
- @floor: Give them the floor.

@promise
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Many of them come over, and the district will expect the promise kept.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have nothing to promise them.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.congress_last_moved = RG.congress.convert('ruhr', 0.35);
RG.congress.tally();
RG.district('ruhr', {loyalty: 6});
!}

[? if congress_last_moved > 0 : [+ congress_last_moved +] of the Ruhr delegates come over to our motion. ?][? if congress_last_moved = 0 : The Ruhr delegates were with us already, and now they expect money as well. ?] Their secretary writes the promise in a notebook.

@floor
subtitle: The hall catches fire. It helps whoever sounds most like the Ruhr.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.offensive_gone == 0) { RG.congress.swayTo('offensive', 0.04); } else { RG.congress.sway(0.02); }
RG.congress.bitter(2);
RG.district('ruhr', {militancy: 6});
!}

A miner from Gelsenkirchen speaks for twenty minutes about French soldiers in the pit yards and German owners in their villas. [+ congress_last_moved +] delegates are carried along with him. Brandler, on the platform, applauds carefully.
